<SceneText>
  <Speakers>
    <Section>Speaker</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49004,49476,49956,50184</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Dio&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49076,49732</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mel&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Mel&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49232,49352,49636,49888,50100</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>アルベルト</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Albert</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49008</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_008_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あれ？　なんかヘンくね？
さっきまで戦い疲れてたのに……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh? Isn't this kinda weird? I was
getting tired from all these battles, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49080</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_008_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>体力が回復してる？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Your stamina's been
restored?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49236</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_008_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>エッヘヘ～ン！　アルベルト様が教えてやるだーよ。
それも『なりきり士』の力のひとつだ、&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Heheheeh! Let the Great Albert explain, won't ya?
That's one of the powers of a "Roleplayer," &lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;. ∀</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49356</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_008_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ノルン様の加護ある場所なら、
大地の力で体力も全回復だ～～よ♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whenever you're in a spot what's under the Great
Norn's protection, yer stamina'll be fully recovered. ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49480</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_008_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おまえがそんなでけーずーたい隠して、
手伝わないから疲れるんだっての！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We're only tired 'cause you're always hiding your
gigantic friggin' body and never help us out!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49640</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_008_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>はん、おら、戦ってもええだが、衣装がボロボロになるだど！
偉そうなこと言って。おめぇが使えねぇからだろ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, I *could* fight with ya, but your clothes'd be ruined! Now
settle down! This's all 'cause you're so useless, to start with.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49736</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_008_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;、アルベルトさんも……
やめてください</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Dio&gt;, Albert...
Please stop this.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49892</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_008_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あう～～ん、&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;ぅ、言ってやってほしいだ。
このクソぼうずに、おらがどれだけ大変かっちゅーの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oooooohh, &lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;~, please tell 'im. Make this
damn brat understand how hard I've got it~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49960</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_008_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>こんのぉ～……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You friggin'...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>50104</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_008_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>っつーことで、ダンジョンから外に出れば、
体力が全快だで、いちいち寝る必要もないだーよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Anyway, when ya exit a dungeon, you'll recover
all yer stamina, so ya won't need an inn, y'see?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>50188</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_008_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……誰に向かって
言ってんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Who are you
talking to?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Notice</Section>
  </Strings>
</SceneText>
